From: fedoraforsnapdragon <52586739+Dudiebug@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: romulus13: enable the Iris video codec

Enable video-codec@aa00000 on both 13.8-inch device trees (I2C and SPI
touchscreen), the way 0019 does for the 15-inch model, so players and
Moonlight can use hardware H.264/HEVC decode through V4L2. Same
Microsoft-signed qcvss8380.mbn, same Romulus firmware directory.

Separate from 0101 so it can be dropped if Iris misbehaves on this unit.
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-microsoft-romulus13-spi-touch.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-microsoft-romulus13-spi-touch.dts
index 1b43b6d4a..90e726e65 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-microsoft-romulus13-spi-touch.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-microsoft-romulus13-spi-touch.dts
@@ -21,3 +21,15 @@ / {
 #include "x1e80100-microsoft-romulus15-touchscreen.dtsi"
 
 #include "x1e80100-microsoft-romulus15-gpio-power.dtsi"
+
+/*
+ * Hardware video decode and encode, as on the 15-inch model. The codec needs
+ * Microsoft-signed firmware, qcvss8380.mbn from the Windows driver store, next
+ * to the other Romulus DSP firmware. It loads on first use; until then,
+ * opening the device fails.
+ */
+&iris {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/x1e80100/microsoft/Romulus/qcvss8380.mbn";
+
+	status = "okay";
+};
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-microsoft-romulus13.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-microsoft-romulus13.dts
index 03dcfadc0..df4c92b8c 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-microsoft-romulus13.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-microsoft-romulus13.dts
@@ -68,3 +68,15 @@ &spi19_hid0_reset_deassert {
 &spi19_hid0_reset_assert {
 	pins = "gpio120";
 };
+
+/*
+ * Hardware video decode and encode, as on the 15-inch model. The codec needs
+ * Microsoft-signed firmware, qcvss8380.mbn from the Windows driver store, next
+ * to the other Romulus DSP firmware. It loads on first use; until then,
+ * opening the device fails.
+ */
+&iris {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/x1e80100/microsoft/Romulus/qcvss8380.mbn";
+
+	status = "okay";
+};
